{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_02_beg","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":4,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_01_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-2","storyName":"大头鬼","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"岁将望困入记忆的囚笼：余降世后，诸位岁兽代理人身边的怪事不断，种种异象皆指向岁的苏醒。颉向望展示书刀的威能，她正积极寻求除岁的方法。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_02_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":2,"next":4,"characters":["朔","望","？？？","余","颉"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":4},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_bg_70_g7_suilingcore.png","x":"0","y":"-150","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"5","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14mini/m_sys_act14mini_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你来了。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"还是这一局棋......千年来，你已经输了无数次的棋局。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你妄图以分身对抗整体......这些苦心孤诣的谋划，在我看来，不过是顽童游戏。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"沉溺于儿戏之中，正是你一如既往的恶习。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你这一次挑战，也不过是对以往千万遍惨败的重复。","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"......呵。","id":17},{"type":"text","text":"你还在用傲慢遮掩你的恐惧。","id":18},{"type":"text","text":"何必徒劳？","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"愤怒，害怕，期待......你想在我身上看见的东西，我在你身上一览无遗。","id":20},{"type":"text","text":"如果你不害怕，那便入局。","id":21},{"type":"text","text":"这一次......","id":22},{"type":"text","text":"输的一定会是你。","id":23},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":24},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_weiqi_heavy","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"curtain","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":32},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_bg_70_g11_oldpavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"这一局，是我输了。","id":34},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":37},{"type":"animtext","id":38,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>593年</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":39},{"type":"animtextclean","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act23side/m_sys_act23side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":42,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"没想到这边对杀还有这一种变化......真是失算了。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#2$2","duration":"1","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......百手左右，要不是你在腹地一味退让求和，说不定还有争胜可能。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D6/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"原来如此......那时算不清后续变化，就只能选了最稳妥的下法。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"哈哈，我还以为最近在棋艺上有些长进，看来还是差你许多。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"最近这一战，多亏你以逸待劳、诱敌深入的计策，我军才得以避免许多伤亡。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你这次回京可以好好歇息一阵，只是下次再见，恐怕又得是许久之后了。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#2$2","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你倒是一点都没有把胜负放在心上。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D6/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"兄弟相处，又不是庙算胜负，何必这么计较。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"不光是下棋，我看你不管在哪都乐意做宅心仁厚的老好人，什么事都可以不放在心上。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"这又是从何说起......","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"两月前，新上任的兵部右侍郎连同礼部共参了你一本。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"拥兵独断，不是小罪名。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"近半年来你我一直同在前线，你如何能得知朝中的事？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我自有办法，你应该担心的是你自己。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"如果他说的是之前我带兵不曾按时回营的事，那是因为行军途中突遇天灾，不得不另外扎营。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"这件事杨将军当时便已经知晓，就算兵部追责起来，也当有公论。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"倒不是让你担心这一件事。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"那位侍郎被查出收受贿赂，手伸到了军需用度上......此时应该正在狱中候审。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"暂时不会再由着他谣言惑众，至于能不能活着从狱里出来，就要看他的运气了。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你答应过我，不会再染指朝堂政事。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"明明是帮大炎除去了一个不干净的官员，怎么还反过来指责我多管闲事？","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你很清楚自己到底是什么用心......","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你是觉得整个朝堂都是你的棋局，别人的性命都是你的掌上玩物？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......呵，你愿意当正人君子，难道你就看不到有多少人用心险恶？","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"那人刚上任就敢将矛头指向你，难道背后没有他人指使？想要与我们为敌的岂止一人？","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"对这一人手软，后患无穷。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#9$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"从幺弟诞生以来，我们周遭发生了多少怪事。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......方的病人明明见好，却莫名其妙地投了井。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"有人模仿夕的笔触，借她的名头画了不少颠倒黑白的“讽喻之作”。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"易的园子进了盗匪，丢失了几件重要的藏物。大理寺严加审问，到最后发现只是一伙不折不扣的笨贼。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"然后，就是关于你的事。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们都清楚......祂还未死。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这里的人们从未忘记祂是何等恐怖之物，直到现在，我们的一举一动，每一次见面，都要被严加监管。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"难道你还认为，靠你立下的一星半点的功绩，就可以让人不把我们当作其心可诛的异类？","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"方弟和夕妹......都还好吗？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"方的确消沉了一阵子，夕从来都是如此，不过想必他们都不至于太放在心上。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"问题在于，今后又该如何？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你认为，这一切背后都有人在操纵？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"是山海众，还是其他人别有用心？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......这才是我担心的。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"如果这些事背后都有一个统一的指使者......","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我算不到此人会是谁，更不知道他意图如何。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"你说的这些事，我会找司岁台一一核实。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......我知道你是好心。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"下次别再行这种逾矩之事。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们之间何曾是彼此担忧的关系？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我只是不想遭人陷害还一无所知。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"时候差不多了，该走了。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"路途遥远，路上多加小心。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"回京后，代我问候他们吧。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......我未必会去见他们。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":135},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#3$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"唉。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":144},{"type":"background","id":145},{"type":"text","text":"代理人于是辞别手足同胞，向京城的方向走去。","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"路途遥远，他走得很急，没时间为了路上听见的一丝杂音驻足。","id":147},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":148},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"一招不慎......","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"满盘皆输......","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"那，我们就从余开始，怎么样？","id":155},{"type":"text","text":"好啊。余......我想想......","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"余音绕梁。","id":159},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_bg_70_g12_oldyanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suifamilybond_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_suifamilybond_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":163,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"梁、梁......","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#3$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"......","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F8/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"三姐，梁......梁字能接什么成语啊？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"该不会刚一开始就要认输了吧？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"怎、怎么会，我就是忙着处理兽肉，没工夫想。再给我点时间嘛。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#8$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"好，好......我还有不少书要抄，你慢慢想，不着急。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"梁......感觉应该去抓四哥问问，但是四哥又不在......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#20$1","id":182},{"type":"multiline","name":"余","text":"横梁、房梁、栋梁——栋梁之材！","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#19$1","id":184},{"type":"multiline","name":"余","text":"不对，梁字应该在第一个......","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#17$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"（对了，三姐手边有那么多写字的竹简，偷偷看一眼，没准......）","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"小余？怎么了？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#10$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"——没事没事！","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#8$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"对了，三姐。你为什么要把这些竹简上的字，全部抄到这些方片上呀？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"这是最近人们的新发明，叫“纸”。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"你看，它比竹简轻便，写起字来更容易，还不会轻易生虫腐化，更方便保存呢。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#8$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"写在“纸”上的东西，就能永远保存下来？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"是，也不全是。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"写在竹简上的东西或许可以完整留存几十年，写在纸上的文字，也许能保存数百年。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#4$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"但竹简也好纸张也罢，总还是会有腐化的一天。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"无论用什么东西去记载，只有记下来的东西，真正被人们记住了，那才能永远地留存下去。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"就像小余做的菜一样，人们尝过了，也会永远记住的。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#14$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"唔......","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":209},{"type":"text","text":"男孩似懂非懂地听着，坐在刚处理好的整只牧兽旁边抓耳挠腮，怎么也想不出那个“梁”开头的成语。","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"一枚从竹简上削下来，带着一小段话的薄片忽然落在他面前。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#21$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"梁上君子！","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C4/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"不错不错，“梁上君子”。让我想想，子字该接的是......子虚——","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#19$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"不、不玩啦，还是等下次大姐和夕姐在的时候我看你们玩吧。这个“接龙”的游戏好难啊。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#5$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"三姐，你饿不饿？要不要我把兽肉做了？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"好啊。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"这些竹简要是不用了，能不能也给我？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#3$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"要拿来生火吗？可以是可以......","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_70_i01_2.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"年幼的代理人从姐姐手里接过竹简，熟练地从中间剖开......","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrapebamboo","channel":"1","id":233},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrapebamboo","channel":"2","delay":"1","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"削成一根一根的竹签。","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"这是要做......？","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"烤肉串！","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"这头牧兽的里脊肥瘦正好，肚子上的膘也挺厚实，拿来做烤肉肯定好吃。","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"至于烧火的材料，还得是木炭。这些竹简烧不久的。","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"木炭我早就备好了，等竹签削好，肉串串完，就可以开始烤肉啦。","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"哈哈......这是不是也算人们说的“吃墨水”？","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"嘿嘿，那这道菜就叫，“墨水烤肉”！","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"小余的手艺总不会错，我就等着大饱口福啦。","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"喏，正好这些竹简也抄好了，你都拿去吧。","id":244},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......你们都在。","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_70_i01_1.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"啊......你回来了？","id":253},{"type":"dialog","id":254},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_70_i01_3.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":255},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"35","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"欸......？","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"二......二哥？","id":258},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"之前收到了信，我还以为你要过几天才能到呢。","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"路上还顺利？","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"嗯。","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你们......","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"只听说过有人焚琴煮羽，已经是糟蹋败坏至极。","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这是在拿书简做什么？","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"我......不是......","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"这是......三姐给我的......","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"dialog","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"image","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":273},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_bg_70_g12_oldyanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"1","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"看到从屋外走进来的男人，男孩怯生生地躲在姐姐的身后，只露出半个脑袋。","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"只是一些坏了的竹简，就交给小余物尽其用了。你凶什么？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"小余好心准备晚饭，你还不领情？","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我也没说什么......","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#10$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"二哥三姐......！你们别吵架！","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#5$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"我先去准备晚饭！二哥回来一趟不容易，今天我们终于能一起吃晚饭啦！","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#9$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"余","text":"你......你们先聊！","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2026_yu_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":293},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1.5","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","duration":"0.5","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","duration":"0.5","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"唉......","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"他本来就有些怯你，你就不能稍微温柔一点？","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"事情不顺利？","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"嗯。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我明白了......","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"不过我们一家人难得能聚一次，小余也总惦记着你。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"有什么事，等先吃完饭再说，好吗？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":314},{"type":"dialog","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","id":320},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_bg_bg_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":324,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"原来在我不知道的地方，还发生了这么多令人不安的事。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你看上去倒一点也不担忧。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"当然还是会担忧的，我只是有些惊讶......原来二哥也会这样关心我们兄弟姐妹。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"只是诞生于同一个破碎的意识，与所谓的血亲哪有半分相似。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"各自志趣有别，生死无关，到底是......道不相同。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"二哥当真是这样想的？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我的想法倒是不一样。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"你看，我们来到这世上已有数百年，就算无法完全融入其中，所见的那些风景人物，大多是可爱的。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"可是每每遇到可以交谈相识的人，仿佛只是须臾一瞬，就已经变成过往云烟。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"到最后，留在身边的，还能说些真心话的人，还是只有“我们”......","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"就算有些矛盾，性格脾气有不合的地方，但无论如何也无法割舍......这样的关系，难道不是像极了人世间的兄弟姐妹？","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......你愿意这样想，我也无意辩驳。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"唉......真不知道你为什么总是这副拒人千里之外的样子。我们好不容易能见一次面，难道一点都不开心？","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"要是哪一天，哪个弟弟妹妹突然消失，你再也见不到了，我倒要看看你会不会后悔。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"对了，二哥既然说到这些事，不久前，我也遇上了一件怪事。","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"有一天夜里，我正准备睡觉，突然听见书房里有响动。","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我在院中，隔着窗户仿佛看到一个人影正伏在案上，似乎在写些什么东西。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我连忙赶了进去，没看到什么人，只看到了几天前我誊抄的那本《急就章》摊开放在书桌上。不知道被什么人涂画成了这个样子......","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"颉说着，从书桌上找出了那本书帖。","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":363},{"type":"text","text":"书上每个笔迹工整的文字上，都覆写上了同一个字。","id":364},{"type":"dialog","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"sticker","id":367,"multi":"true","text":"<color=#d70000>岁</color>","x":"330","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"28","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"2"},{"type":"sticker","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#12$2","focus":"l","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"——！","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"二哥......你觉得这究竟会是何人所为？","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......只可能是祂。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"祂在苏醒，祂正在通过某种方式干涉我们。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"在余降世后，我们原本都以为祂的神识应当已经被消磨殆尽。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"可祂还活着......祂现在还在沉睡，却成了我们每个人的梦魇。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"如果有朝一日祂醒来，那我们则会变成祂浮光泡影的梦......","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"关于此事，二哥有什么主意？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","focus":"l","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我暂时还不知道，但我会想办法......","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"那要不要听一听，我的主意？","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"其实我也是直到最近才想到......起因是我发现，我和炎国的人们一同编撰史书的时候，无论多么小心，总还是会有犯错的时候。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"不同于寻常文章，写在史书上的错，想要去删改修正，可要花费不少功夫。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrapebook_quick","volume":"0.5","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"说着，颉拿起书桌上一柄用于削竹简的书刀，又随手拾起一卷书，用书刀在纸上轻轻一刮。","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"深深沁入纸张，甚至有少许洇在了下一页上的墨迹，随着书刀和纸页的接触消逝无踪，纸面重新变得光洁如新。","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"这书刀......","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"大概是沾染了一些我的气息，变得有些不寻常了。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我隐隐有种感觉，它刮去的文字——一段历史，或者，也许至少......一个名字——不仅会消失在纸上，也会从人们心中被抹除。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我在想，或许终有一天，我们可以用它，从世上的所有文字中，抹去“岁”这个字呢。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你能够做到......这种事？","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F5/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"现在还不能。现在它只是一把有点神奇之处的书刀。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"但是我能感觉得到，记述的文字越多，我手中的刀和笔，便越有分量。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"也许我们都一样，我们从那片混沌鸿蒙中找到了“我是谁”的答案，又在这人世间明确了自己存在的意义，这正是我们有别于祂的证明。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"也许有朝一日，我们拥有的力量会超越祂，到那时，我们就能够摆脱祂的影响，真正作为“我们”而活着。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"当然前提是，我们绝对不可以忘了自己是谁。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$2","focus":"l","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"二哥？你又在一个人想什么呢？","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"不......不必在意。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"唉......有时候我在想，或许兄弟姐妹当中，我和你的脾气应该是最不对付的。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"算计筹谋，都是要藏在心里的东西，但是文字语言，却是要把心中所想传达出来......","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"但有时候我又偏偏觉得，你对我明明毫无隐瞒。你心里想的，我都能看到。","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$2","focus":"l","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我对你......","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","text":"","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"想来也真有趣，我们各自在这世上找到了一样尽心钻研的事物，结果像是反过来被改变了个性一样。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"黍常常说我总是沉湎过去，我也记得她说过的，在未来尽头看到的那一片雪白的死寂。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"她说得也没错，心里有放不下的事，到底是没办法强装豁达的。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"我知道，二哥始终在担忧那个不可知的将来......你最在意胜负，可若只有胜负，这活法未免也太干瘪枯瘦了些。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"二哥，在胜负之外，你牵挂的到底是什么呢？","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"并非牵挂胜负，只是......","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"只是对必败的棋局，心有不甘。","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"唔......","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"对了，你明天不是要回司岁台述职？那我抄好的这些书，就麻烦二哥帮我顺路送去了。进天镜阁前，这些书他们还要再过一遍。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......好。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"还有，那卷重新抄过的《急就章》，麻烦二哥上交之前再帮我仔细看看吧。书刀也给你，免得有错字不好改。","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你经手的文章，哪里用得到我来核查。","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D6/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"就当是你最近闲时的消遣，随便看看嘛。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"二哥常年为战事筹谋，心里都被胜负得失占满了。不如做点别的事，换换心情？","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"而且，说不定能在文章里发现你在找的东西呢？","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":448},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":449},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":450},{"type":"bgeffect","id":451},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":452},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":453},{"type":"image","id":454},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":455}],"characters":["朔","望","？？？","余","颉"]}